<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS4" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ Probabilistic Optimality for Inference-time Scaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.4 </span>How <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">OptScale</span> is Sensitive to Hyperparameters?</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS5" title="In 4 Experiments ‣ Probabilistic Optimality for Inference-time Scaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.5 </span>Can <span class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">OptScale</span> Achieve a New SOTA Performance across Benchmarks?</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Probabilistic Optimality for Inference-time Scaling" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
