<tr id="S4.T1.5.1.8" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.5.1.8.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">Beam Search<span id="footnotex2" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup>
                    <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">3</span>
                    
                    
                    
                  We identified incomplete token consumption estimation for Beam Search and the DVTS-based methods in their original Hugging Face implementation.
Specifically, these methods only accounted for tokens in the final response, rather than tracking the total number of tokens generated across all intermediate beamed responses, leading to substantially underestimated token consumption reports.
However, while we have now resolved this bug in the implementation, due to the time limitation, we currently lack updated results reflecting this correction.</span></span></span></td>
<td id="S4.T1.5.1.8.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">7.8</td>
