<figure id="A1.T6" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A1.T6.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 6</span>: </span><span id="A1.T6.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Case 5 (Dataset: AIME25, Backbone Model: Deepseek-R1-Distill-Qwen-7B).</span></figcaption>
<table id="A1.T6.5" class="ltx_tabular">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A1.T6.5.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.5.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" colspan="3">
<span id="A1.T6.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:331.2pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;">Question:<span id="A1.T6.5.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> <span id="A1.T6.5.1.1.1.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">Let <math id="A1.T6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> be real numbers such that the system <math id="A1.T6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|25+20i-z|=5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">25</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">+</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">20</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">i</mi></mrow></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">z</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">=</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|25+20i-z|=5</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.T6.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|z-4-k|=|z-3i-k|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">z</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">4</mn><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">k</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">=</mo><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">z</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">−</mo><mrow><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">i</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">−</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">k</mi></mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF" stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|z-4-k|=|z-3i-k|</annotation></semantics></math> has exactly one complex solution <math id="A1.T6.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">z</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z</annotation></semantics></math>. The sum of all possible values of <math id="A1.T6.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> can be written as <math id="A1.T6.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{m}{n}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF"><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">m</mi><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">n</mi></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{m}{n}</annotation></semantics></math>, where <math id="A1.T6.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">m</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.T6.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <math id="A1.T6.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m+n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">m</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">+</mo><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m+n</annotation></semantics></math>. Here <math id="A1.T6.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i=\sqrt{-1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">i</mi><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">=</mo><msqrt style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF"><mrow><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">−</mo><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;--ltx-bg-color:#F2F2F2;" mathbackground="#F2F2F2" mathcolor="#0000FF">1</mn></mrow></msqrt></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i=\sqrt{-1}</annotation></semantics></math>.</span></span></span></span>
</span></th></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.5.2" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A1.T6.5.2.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">N</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="A1.T6.5.2.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.2.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:213.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.2.2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.2.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Best-of-N (BoN)</span></span>
</span></th>
<th id="A1.T6.5.2.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.2.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.2.3.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.2.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold ltx_font_smallcaps">OptScale</span></span>
</span></th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody class="ltx_tbody">
<tr id="A1.T6.5.3" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.5.3.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.3.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Completion 1</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.5.3.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:213.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1.1" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Squaring both sides to remove the absolute value and square root, we obtain:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex10" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\left(3k+\frac{73}{2}\right)^{2}=25(2k^{2}+14k+25)" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>73</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>14</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>25</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\left(3k+\frac{73}{2}\right)^{2}=25(2k^{2}+14k+25)</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Expanding and simplifying, we get the quadratic equation:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex11" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="164k^{2}+524k-2829=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>164</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>524</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2829</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">164k^{2}+524k-2829=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Using the quadratic formula, the sum of the roots of this quadratic equation is:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex12" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-\frac{b}{a}=-\frac{524}{164}=-\frac{131}{41}" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mfrac></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>524</mn><mn>164</mn></mfrac></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>131</mn><mn>41</mn></mfrac></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\frac{b}{a}=-\frac{524}{164}=-\frac{131}{41}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">So, <math id="A1.T6.m11" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m=131" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>131</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m=131</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A1.T6.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n=41" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n=41</annotation></semantics></math>, and <math id="A1.T6.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m+n={\color[rgb]{1,0,0}\boxed{172}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><menclose notation="box"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000">172</mn></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m+n={\color[rgb]{1,0,0}\boxed{172}}</annotation></semantics></math>.
<br class="ltx_break"><span id="A1.T6.5.3.2.1.1.4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_upright">(Incorrect)</span></span></span>
</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.5.3.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.3.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.3.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Same as BoN</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.5.4" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.5.4.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.4.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Completion 2-4</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.5.4.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:213.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Given <math id="A1.T6.m14" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>k</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k</annotation></semantics></math> is a real number, the system:
<br class="ltx_break"></span>1. <math id="A1.T6.m15" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|25+20i-z|=5" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>25</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mn>20</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|25+20i-z|=5</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p">2. <math id="A1.T6.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="|z-4-k|=|z-3i-k|" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mi>z</mi><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">|z-4-k|=|z-3i-k|</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">represents a circle and a perpendicular bisector. The bisector of points <math id="A1.T6.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(4+k,0)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(4+k,0)</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="A1.T6.m18" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(k,3)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(k,3)</annotation></semantics></math> has midpoint <math id="A1.T6.m19" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(2+k,\tfrac{3}{2})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(2+k,\tfrac{3}{2})</annotation></semantics></math> and slope <math id="A1.T6.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="-\tfrac{3}{4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">-\tfrac{3}{4}</annotation></semantics></math>, so the perpendicular bisector has slope <math id="A1.T6.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\tfrac{4}{3}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\tfrac{4}{3}</annotation></semantics></math>. Equation:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex13" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="8x-6y-8k-7=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>y</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">8x-6y-8k-7=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Distance from center <math id="A1.T6.m22" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(25,20)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mn>25</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(25,20)</annotation></semantics></math> to line equals radius:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex14" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{|73-8k|}{10}=5\Rightarrow|73-8k|=50" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mn>73</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mn>10</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy="false">⇒</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mn>73</mn><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{|73-8k|}{10}=5\Rightarrow|73-8k|=50</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Solving:
<br class="ltx_break"><math id="A1.T6.m23" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=\frac{23}{8}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>23</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=\frac{23}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, <math id="A1.T6.m24" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k=\frac{123}{8}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>123</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k=\frac{123}{8}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.4.2.1.1.6.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Sum: </span> <math id="A1.T6.m25" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{146}{8}=\frac{73}{4}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>146</mn><mn>8</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>73</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{146}{8}=\frac{73}{4}</annotation></semantics></math>, so <math id="A1.T6.m26" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m+n={\color[rgb]{0,0,1}\boxed{77}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><menclose notation="box"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;" mathcolor="#0000FF">77</mn></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m+n={\color[rgb]{0,0,1}\boxed{77}}</annotation></semantics></math> 
<br class="ltx_break">(Correct)</span>
</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.5.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.4.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Same as BoN</span>
</span></td></tr>
<tr id="A1.T6.5.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="A1.T6.5.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.5.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:56.9pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.5.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.5.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Completion 5</span></span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.5.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_r ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.5.2.1" class="ltx_inline-block" style="width:213.4pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.5.2.1.1" class="ltx_block ltx_minipage ltx_align_top" style="width:345.0pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.5.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.5.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Another geometric interpretation gives a different line and leads to:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex15" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{|58k-73|}{\sqrt{4k^{2}-32k+100}}=5" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mrow><mrow><mn>58</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>73</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow><msqrt><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>32</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>100</mn></mrow></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{|58k-73|}{\sqrt{4k^{2}-32k+100}}=5</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.5.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.5.2.1.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Squaring and simplifying:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></span>
<span id="A1.Ex16" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<span><span class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="A1.Ex16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1088k^{2}-2556k+943=0" display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mn>1088</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>k</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mn>2556</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>943</mn></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1088k^{2}-2556k+943=0</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></span></span></span>
</span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.5.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.T6.5.5.2.1.1.3.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Sum of roots: </span> <math id="A1.T6.m27" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\frac{2556}{1088}=\frac{639}{272}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>2556</mn><mn>1088</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>639</mn><mn>272</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\frac{2556}{1088}=\frac{639}{272}</annotation></semantics></math>, so <math id="A1.T6.m28" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m+n={\color[rgb]{1,0,0}\boxed{911}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo>=</mo><menclose notation="box"><mn style="--ltx-fg-color:#FF0000;" mathcolor="#FF0000">911</mn></menclose></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m+n={\color[rgb]{1,0,0}\boxed{911}}</annotation></semantics></math></span>
<span id="A1.T6.5.5.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_p">(Incorrect)</span>
</span>
</span></td>
<td id="A1.T6.5.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_align_top ltx_border_t">
<span id="A1.T6.5.5.3.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_top" style="width:71.1pt;">
<span id="A1.T6.5.5.3.1.1" class="ltx_p">Same as BoN</span>
</span></td></tr>
